{"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","title":"reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)","externalID":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV9reconcile4with8deleting10preservingyACyxG_Shy10Foundation4UUIDVGALtF","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reconcile"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV","text":"EntityStore"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"deleting"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"preserving"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID"},{"kind":"text","text":">)"}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reconcile"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"remote"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV","text":"EntityStore"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"deleting"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"deletedIDs"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"preserving"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID"},{"kind":"text","text":">)"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The rows read from storage for the IDs in question. Rows for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"IDs the caller didn’t ask about are simply not here, and their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"absence means nothing."}]}],"name":"remote"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IDs storage reports as deleted elsewhere. Removed with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same origin a full reconcile uses, so no deletion is recorded and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"none is echoed back to the store it came from. An ID that "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"remote"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still holds is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" removed however it is named here: a live row"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is positive evidence, and a tombstone can be stale."}]}],"name":"deletedIDs"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IDs the caller knows carry unflushed local intent, exactly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as in the full reconcile. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"remote"},{"type":"text","text":" has no authority over them, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"neither does "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deletedIDs"},{"type":"text","text":". This store’s own un-drained "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/changes"},{"type":"text","text":" are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"folded in automatically."}]}],"name":"preserving"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The counterpart to "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)"},{"type":"text","text":" for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"partial read — a refresh of the rows a sync tick reported as changed,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than of the whole table. Absorbing rows works identically; what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changes is where deletions come from."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A partial snapshot "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"cannot"}]},{"type":"text","text":" infer deletion from absence. An ID missing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from it was not deleted, it was not asked for, and treating the two alike"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"would empty the store on the first partial merge. So removal is driven"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entirely by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deletedIDs"},{"type":"text","text":", which the caller must have positive evidence"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for — a history tombstone, not an empty result."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Does "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"type":"text","text":" record changes — this is a hydration operation, for the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reason the full reconcile isn’t one."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reconciles this store against a snapshot covering only "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"some"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" of its IDs."}],"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)":{"title":"reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reconcile","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"with","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntityStore","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"preserving","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"removingMissing","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reconciles this store against an authoritative snapshot from storage."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/reconcile(with:preserving:removingmissing:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux":{"title":"Swidux","abstract":[{"text":"Redux-style state management for SwiftUI, with macros for observability and ready-made plugins for persistence, undo, paywalls, version killswitches, and parental gates.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swidux","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","role":"collection"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/changes":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Accumulated changes since the last ","type":"text"},{"code":"resetChanges()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" call.","type":"text"}],"title":"changes","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/changes","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/changes","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"changes"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux9ChangeSetV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ChangeSet"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore":{"title":"EntityStore","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntityStore","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EntityStore","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore","abstract":[{"text":"An ordered, keyed collection of identifiable entities that silently records","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every mutation for downstream persistence.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)":{"title":"reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)","fragments":[{"text":"func"